From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Dmitry Afonchenko <undermove1@gmail.com>
Date: Mon, 16 Nov 2026 12:46:19 +0400
Subject: [PATCH 145/202] Meridian: picture in picture as in Arc: every space,
 its links, its header

- Both kinds of picture-in-picture window show on full screen spaces too
  (another app's, a full screen window).
- A link in one opens as a tab of the opener's window. It opened a new
  window: WebUIBrowserWindow::IsOnCurrentWorkspace() said false, so the
  navigator never reused a window.
- A document picture-in-picture page's "app-region: drag" (Kontur
  Talk's header) moves the window.
- Test hook: TestFloatingWindows().

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
Claude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01SwxrQ2eLfJ2bv8cCoG2va1
